CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'state == GFS2_BLKST_FREE'
#87: FILE: fs/gfs2/rgrp.c:1668:
+		if ((ip == NULL || !gfs2_rs_active(&ip->i_res)) &&
+		    test_bit(GBF_FULL, &bi->bi_flags) &&
 		    (state == GFS2_BLKST_FREE))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

